===TRINO===
  Trino commands (query, catalogs, schemas, tables).

Options:
  --json                  Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs and
                          scripts).
  -q, --quiet             Suppress success/info/warn lines; print only data +
                          errors.
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  catalogs  List Trino catalogs visible to the current user.
  describe  Describe TABLE_REF (``<catalog>.<schema>.<table>`` or...
  info      Show the host/port/user the CLI would connect with.
  query     Run an ad-hoc SQL query.
  schemas   List schemas in CATALOG.
  sql       Run an ad-hoc SQL query.
  tables    List tables in TARGET (``<catalog>.<schema>`` or just...
